The game is heavily inspired by Space Station 13 and a game concept called Pressure.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/barotrauma', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 9.02, '2026-08-28 09:15:02', '2026-08-28 09:15:02');
